  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう、果穂。こんな朝早くから何してるんだ？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001410020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　ユニットのみんながいつ来てもいいように、\r\nいろいろ準備してるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100141/1009001001410020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（見えないところでも、仲間のことを\r\n考えてるんだな、果穂は……）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "果穂がいてくれると\r\n安心できるな",
    "nextLabel": "1009001001411"
  },
  {
    "select": "仲間を\r\n陰から支えるなんて\r\nかっこいいな",
    "nextLabel": "1009001001412"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "みんなが来るまでに\r\n疲れるかも",
    "nextLabel": "1009001001413"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001410030,
    "label": "1009001001411",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ。プロデューサーさんにそう言ってもらえると、\r\nとってもうれしいです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100141/1009001001410030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001410040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "これからも、みんなとプロデューサーさんのために、\r\n頑張ります！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100141/1009001001410040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001410050,
    "label": "1009001001412",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ。これくらいなんてことないです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100141/1009001001410050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001410060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "仲間のみんなが戦いやすくするのも、\r\nユニットのレッドの使命ですから！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100141/1009001001410060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001410070,
    "label": "1009001001413",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "うーん。そういえば、みんなが来るまで\r\nまだ時間があります……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100141/1009001001410070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001001410080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でもでも、遅くなるより早すぎるほうが\r\nいいですよね？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100141/1009001001410080"
  },
  {
